    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating story of the Aztecs and their intricate relationships with the gods, develop trade, build a city, and try to teach the Aztec god Huitzilopochtli to embrace veganism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, we\u2019ve introduced changes to Match-3 gameplay and revamped the logic behind mahjong layout designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features numerous Match-3 levels with diverse mechanics, as well as bonus games that are completely skippable\u2014you can play them after finishing the main game or skip them altogether. Additionally, you\u2019ll need to build a brand-new city.<br>- 90 new replayable Match 3 levels ( relaxed/limited moves/timed )<br>- 8 skippable tricky Spot The Difference scenes<br>- 20 skippable Mahjong games<br>- 20 skippable Block games<br>- hidden treasures<br>And a story and the town to build!</p>",
